    "title": "Spokane city councilmembers introduce ordinance to impose data center moratorium - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago SPOKANE, Wash. — On Wednesday, Spokane City Councilmembers introduced an ordinance imposing an immediate one-year citywide moratorium on the acceptance, processing, review and approval of building permit applications for the construction of new computer data centers after Avista confirmed Tuesday that a project to build a data center is in the early development stages. Read full article\n2",
